# Content and evidence

- Keep EN/PT-BR public copy equivalent in meaning; update title and meta-description language behavior with positioning changes.
- Source claims from `docs/resume/markdown/` or curated `docs/career/projects/` profiles only.
- Mark missing proof as an owner confirmation item rather than filling gaps with inferred metrics or URLs.
- Keep roadmap skills framed as in-progress until a verified public project supports the claim.
